              Comprehensive growth planning covering financial health, unit economics, revenue forecasting, cash flow, pricing strategy, and business valuation.
            </p>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900 text-green-800 dark:text-green-200 text-xs font-medium rounded-full">New</span>
